NAME: do-while GT counts down
DESCRIPTION: x from 5 to 3 while x > 3: one repeat, one exit; i-7d2612-fffa6c, see behtests/dowhile_gt_count.beh
SRC:
(let (x 5)
  (let (y 3)
    (seq
      (JMP (Dir 2))
      (DAT (store x) (store y))
      (do-while (GT x y)
        (SUB 1 x)) )))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b

  JMP    $2     , #0     
LET1  
LET2  
  DAT    #5     , #3     
DWH9  
  SUB.A  #1     , $LET1  
  SLT.BA $LET2  , $LET1  
  SNE.AB #0     , #1     
  JMP    $DWH9  , #0     
  DAT    #0     , #0     